{'symbol': 'GEN', 'date': '2023-03-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'LIFELOCK EMPOWERS TAXPAYERS WITH KNOWLEDGE TO HELP FIGHT FRAUD', 'text': 'TEMPE, ARIZ., AND PRAGUE , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WITH TAX SEASON AT ITS MIDPOINT, LIFELOCK, A LEADING IDENTITY PROTECTION BRAND OF GEN™ (NASDAQ: GEN), TODAY RELEASED EXPERT INSIGHT ON DUBIOUS AND SURPRISING METHODS CRIMINALS ARE TAKING TO DEFRAUD UNSUSPECTING TAXPAYERS, AS WELL AS TIPS ON HOW TO PROTECT THEIR IDENTITIES AND TAX REFUNDS FROM BEING STOLEN.'}